From 598d911012457599d0f17c2db4083375ff269a60 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 15:37:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Mod entities walk vanilla's found paths (FORK-10 5c)

path-to now runs vanilla's ground path search (the mobs' PathFinder with the
walk node evaluator: walls, open and closed doors, water, fences, drops) and
the entity follows the waypoints, stepping onto slabs and stairs by their
collision height. A moving goal gets a new path at most every 10 ticks;
nothing reachable or three blocked steps in a row stop it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
